efaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q437","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"By the influence on the results of some extraneous variable that is tied to or correlated with th...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID633","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>By the influence on the results of some extraneous variable\nthat is tied to or correlated with the variable under investigation is insured\nagainst.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID383","SecondaryAttribute":"By the time Viking I touched down on the Plain of Chryse in August, few seemed to care at all.\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>By the time Viking I touched down on the Plain of Chryse in\nAugust, few seemed to care at all.&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q349","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"By the time Viking I touched down on the Plain of Chryse in August, few seemed to care at all.\u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID383","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>By the time Viking I touched down on the Plain of Chryse in\nAugust, few seemed to care at all.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID557","SecondaryAttribute":"By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio managed to conjure up unforgettable scen...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio\nmanaged to conjure up unforgettable scenes of dramatic realism.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q193","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio managed to conjure up unforgettable scen...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID557","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio\nmanaged to conjure up unforgettable scenes of dramatic realism.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID593","SecondaryAttribute":"By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio managed to conjure up unforgettable scen...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio\nmanaged to conjure up unforgettable scenes of dramatic realism.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q428","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio managed to conjure up unforgettable scen...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID593","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>By using stark contrasts of light and shadow, Caravaggio\nmanaged to conjure up unforgettable scenes of dramatic realism.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID517","SecondaryAttribute":"Captain John Smith was chosen as president of the council to see that the laws were implemented.\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Captain John Smith was chosen as president of the council to\nsee that the laws were implemented.&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q395","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Captain John Smith was chosen as president of the council to see that the laws were implemented.\u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID517","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Captain John Smith was chosen as president of the council to\nsee that the laws were implemented.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID556","SecondaryAttribute":"Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated exalted religious subjects in a low, vulgar style.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated exalted\nreligious subjects in a low, vulgar style, because he included in his paintings\nthe faces and figures from the street of common people.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q191","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated exalted religious subjects in a low, vulgar style...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID556","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated exalted\nreligious subjects in a low, vulgar style, because he included in his paintings\nthe faces and figures from the street of common people.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID591","SecondaryAttribute":"Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated sacred religious subjects in a low, vulgar way by.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated sacred\nreligious subjects in a low, vulgar way by including the faces and figures of\ncommon people in his paintings.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q426","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated sacred religious subjects in a low, vulgar way by...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID591","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>Caravaggio\u2019s critics complained that he treated sacred\nreligious subjects in a low, vulgar way by including the faces and figures of\ncommon people in his paintings.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID1","SecondaryAttribute":"Concordia College, Moorhead, MN INFORMED CONSENT STATEMENT PLEASE READ BEFORE COMPLETING THE SURV...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Concordia College, Moorhead, MN<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:13.999999999999998pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">INFORMED CONSENT STATEMENT<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:700;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">PLEASE READ BEFORE COMPLETING THE SURVEY<\/span><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Hello, our names are Claire Clarke, Matthew Kindem, and Kaytlynn Ziegler. We are student researchers researchers in the department of psychology at Concordia College, Moorhead, MN. We would like to invite you to take part in our research concerning mind wandering. The purpose of this study is to investigate the link between mind wandering and reading comprehension. <\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">If you agree to take part in our research, you will be asked to fill out a survey that includes different passages to read and questions about &nbsp;the presented texts. Responding to the surveys should take about 30 minutes of your time. <\/span><span style=\"font-size: 15.3333px; white-space: pre-wrap;\">As a token of appreciation for your time, we will offer you the opportunity to enter a drawing for a $15 gift card upon completion of the survey.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your responses will be confidential. Your name will not be linked to your responses. We will not use your name or other identifying information in any reports of the research.  Your anonymous data will be stored indefinitely on the Open Science Framework (OSF), for future analyses.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your identity and responses will be protected to the extent allowed by law. This means that they will be treated as confidential, unless you disclose information that is construed as threatening to yourself\/others, or as indicative of abuse of minors\/vulnerable adults.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">There are no foreseeable risks to you from participating in this research. We hope that the research will benefit research in our field by providing information about reading comprehension and mind wandering. We also hope that by participating in this study you learn something about what issues are of interest to psychologists, and how research studies are designed and conducted. There will be no costs to you, other than your time involved. <\/span><br>\n&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">Your participation in this research is voluntary. You are free to refuse to take part. You are free to withdraw your consent and discontinue participation in this study at any time by simply not responding to the questions. If you are participating in this study in order to receive credit for a class, rest assured that you may refuse to answer any question(s) that might make you feel uncomfortable and still receive course credit.<\/span><\/p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n<p><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;font-family:'Times New Roman';color:#000000;background-color:transparent;font-weight:400;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;text-decoration:none;vertical-align:baseline;white-space:pre;white-space:pre-wrap;\">No feedback on individual scores will be provided. You will be provided with a debriefing form when you have completed the survey. You may request a copy of the overall 