he found friends in Italy, most of them cultured Americans.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID155","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She found friends in Italy, most of them cultured Americans.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID35","SecondaryAttribute":"She found the man even more to her liking than the verse, and it was not so very long-only the ti...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She found the man even more to her liking than the verse,\nand it was not so very long-only the time between May, 1845 and September,\n1846-before Robert Browning had stolen the poetess from the dour father who\nguarded her like a dragon (never wanting her to marry any man), and taken her\nwith him to Italy and a new life.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q14","QuestionID":"QID35","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She found the man even more to her liking than the verse, and it was not so very long-only the ti...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She found the man even more to her liking than the verse,\nand it was not so very long-only the time between May, 1845 and September,\n1846-before Robert Browning had stolen the poetess from the dour father who\nguarded her like a dragon (never wanting her to marry any man), and taken her\nwith him to Italy and a new life.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID114","SecondaryAttribute":"She found the man even more to her liking than the verse, and it was not so very long-only the ti...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She found the man even more to her liking than the verse,\nand it was not so very long-only the time between May, 1845 and September,\n1846-before Robert Browning had stolen the poetess from the dour father who\nguarded her like a dragon (never wanting her to marry any man), and taken her\nwith him to Italy and a new life.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q229","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She found the man even more to her liking than the verse, and it was not so very long-only the ti...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID114","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She found the man even more to her liking than the verse,\nand it was not so very long-only the time between May, 1845 and September,\n1846-before Robert Browning had stolen the poetess from the dour father who\nguarded her like a dragon (never wanting her to marry any man), and taken her\nwith him to Italy and a new life.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID93","SecondaryAttribute":"She had a sudden and alarming attack of indisposition but was not considered in any precariousnes...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She had a sudden and alarming attack of indisposition but\nwas not considered in any precariousness.&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q48","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She had a sudden and alarming attack of indisposition but was not considered in any precariousnes...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID93","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She had a sudden and alarming attack of indisposition but\nwas not considered in any precariousness.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID185","SecondaryAttribute":"She had a sudden and alarming attack of sickness but was not considered in any danger.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She had a sudden and alarming attack of sickness but was not\nconsidered in any danger.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q271","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She had a sudden and alarming attack of sickness but was not considered in any danger.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID185","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She had a sudden and alarming attack of sickness but was not\nconsidered in any danger.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID189","SecondaryAttribute":"She spoke tenderly about her love for him. In his arms, her head drooped as though in a faint, bu...","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She spoke tenderly about her love for him. In his arms, her\nhead drooped as though in a faint, but it was the end.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q273","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She spoke tenderly about her love for him. In his arms, her head drooped as though in a faint, bu...","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID189","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She spoke tenderly about her love for him. In his arms, her\nhead drooped as though in a faint, but it was the end.<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID674","SecondaryAttribute":"She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the best poet of her sex since Sappho.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<span style=\"font-family: Calibri, sans-serif; font-size: 14.6667px;\">She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the best poet of her sex since Sappho.<\/span>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q652","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the best poet of her sex since Sappho.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID674"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID676","SecondaryAttribute":"She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the best poet of her sex since Sappho.\u00a0","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the\nbest poet of her sex since Sappho.&nbsp;<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q24","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the best poet of her sex since Sappho.\u00a0","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"NextChoiceId":1,"NextAnswerId":1,"QuestionID":"QID676","QuestionText_Unsafe":"<p>She was a pure singer with a lovely lyrical tenderness, the\nbest poet of her sex since Sappho.&nbsp;<\/p>"}},{"SurveyID":"SV_en9q7gEnCvYC6VL","Element":"SQ","PrimaryAttribute":"QID139","SecondaryAttribute":"She was the best poet of her sex since Sappho.","TertiaryAttribute":null,"Payload":{"QuestionText":"<p>She was the best poet of her sex since Sappho.<\/p>","DefaultChoices":false,"DataExportTag":"Q242","QuestionType":"DB","Selector":"TB","Configuration":{"QuestionDescriptionOption":"UseText"},"QuestionDescription":"She was the best poet of her sex since Sappho.","ChoiceOrder":[],"Validation":{"Settings":{"Type":"None"}},"GradingData":[],"Language":[],"Ne